      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumpata yejima yamunu mwishina mwadiŋi idimi dawu dimuhohu, mazu awu wowamu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu hiyakufuma kumusela, awana nichana mwituŋa daShinari, ashakama nikusha kamaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakudileja muntu namukwawu nawu, Tuyenu, twilenu matafwali, tuyochenu chachiwahi. Nanochu chabuliluwu malola hiyakukumina dakutuŋa namatafwalihohu, chabuliluwu samendi hiyakutuŋa namaseki akucha aka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawu, Tuyenu, Tutupenu mukala weneni, nikaposhi kamatafwali, insayaku yakashiki mwiwulu; twakatiyakani ijina, twakabuli kupalaŋana mwahita iseki dejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wenjili mwishina nindi akatali nimukalanikaposhi kakutuŋi awu anyana kawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli nindi, Antu awa himuchidi wumu hohu, wejima wawu akweti idimi dawu dimu; talantahi chakusambishawu; ichi dinu kwosi chuma chakayilekesha kwila mwejima mwanafu ukuluwu munyichima yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuyenu, tusulukenu, twakaluwaŋesheluku idimi dawu, kulonda akeli iwu kutiya mwakuho shamukwawu nehi, iwu kutiya mwakuhosha mukwawu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova yoyimwaŋa kwenoku, hakuyipalapesha mwejima mwahita iseki; mukala aleka nikuwutuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chawutenenawu ni ijina dawu nawu Babeli; nanochuchalu waŋesheliyi Yehova kwenoku idimi dawantu ejima ahamaseki; kwokweno kukwokwa yipalaŋe sheleliyi Yehova mwejima mwahita iseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
