              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tera watambwili mwanindi Abarama, nimwizukulu windi Lotimwana kaHarana, nimuku windi Sarayi iŋoda mwanindi Abarama, hiya kunya mukahamu muUri wamudi aKaladeya ayi muKenani; ashikani kuHarana, ashakama nikwoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
